" transform=\"translate(9002.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(646,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10051.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>सूत्र <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.956ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3516.7 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1267.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(646,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2317.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> से, ऑक्सीजन परमाणुओं की संख्या ज्ञात करने के लिए, हम सीधे रासायनिक सूत्र में ऑक्सीजन के संगत पादांक (subscript) को देखते हैं। इस स्थिति में, पादांक 7 है, जो दर्शात